  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting digital learning transformation in the Arab States</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to accompany digital learning transformation in the region, leveraging Lebanon&apos;s experience as a foundation. Through regional webinars, exchange of good practices, and promotion of the Guidance for generative AI in education and research, the project seeks to enhance digital learning initiatives. At the national level in Lebanon, the project will support the implementation of a robust digital learning strategy being developed. By fostering collaboration and sharing best practices, the project endeavors to catalyze sustainable digital education advancements in the region.</narrative>
  </description>
